{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "devils-hole-cue-1",
      "transcript": "An earthquake nearly four thousand miles away made waves in this Nevada desert pool.",
      "file": "audio/devils-hole/narration/cue-1.wav",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 5.9,
      "beatIndex": 0,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "devils-hole-seismic-seiche.asset.connection.script.1",
      "samples": 141600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "devils-hole-cue-2",
      "transcript": "On July twenty-ninth, twenty twenty-five, a magnitude eight point eight quake struck off Russia’s Kamchatka Peninsula.",
      "file": "audio/devils-hole/narration/cue-2.wav",
      "start": 6.133333333333334,
      "duration": 7.975,
      "beatIndex": 1,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "devils-hole-seismic-seiche.asset.connection.script.2",
      "samples": 191400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "devils-hole-cue-3",
      "transcript": "Twenty-one minutes later, water in Devils Hole began sloshing.",
      "file": "audio/devils-hole/narration/cue-3.wav",
      "start": 14.266666666666667,
      "duration": 4.325,
      "beatIndex": 2,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "devils-hole-seismic-seiche.asset.connection.script.3",
      "samples": 103800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "devils-hole-cue-4",
      "transcript": "But seawater hadn’t crossed the ocean into Nevada.",
      "file": "audio/devils-hole/narration/cue-4.wav",
      "start": 18.733333333333334,
      "duration": 3.3,
      "beatIndex": 3,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "devils-hole-seismic-seiche.asset.connection.script.4",
      "samples": 79200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "devils-hole-cue-5",
      "transcript": "Seismic waves traveled through the ground.",
      "file": "audio/devils-hole/narration/cue-5.wav",
      "start": 22.266666666666666,
      "duration": 2.8,
      "beatIndex": 4,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "devils-hole-seismic-seiche.asset.connection.script.5",
      "samples": 67200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "devils-hole-cue-6",
      "transcript": "As the ground moved, water already inside the cave rocked back and forth—like water in a shaken bathtub.",
      "file": "audio/devils-hole/narration/cue-6.wav",
      "start": 25.2,
      "duration": 7.05,
      "beatIndex": 5,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "devils-hole-seismic-seiche.asset.connection.script.6",
      "samples": 169200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "devils-hole-cue-7",
      "transcript": "That oscillation is called a seismic seiche, different from an ocean tsunami.",
      "file": "audio/devils-hole/narration/cue-7.wav",
      "start": 32.5,
      "duration": 5.1,
      "beatIndex": 6,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "devils-hole-seismic-seiche.asset.connection.script.7",
      "samples": 122400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "devils-hole-cue-8",
      "transcript": "The waves here were about ten inches.",
      "file": "audio/devils-hole/narration/cue-8.wav",
      "start": 37.733333333333334,
      "duration": 2.675,
      "beatIndex": 7,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "devils-hole-seismic-seiche.asset.connection.script.8",
      "samples": 64200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "devils-hole-cue-9",
      "transcript": "Small, but enough to disturb a shallow shelf where the endangered Devils Hole pupfish feed and spawn.",
      "file": "audio/devils-hole/narration/cue-9.wav",
      "start": 40.666666666666664,
      "duration": 6.525,
      "beatIndex": 8,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "devils-hole-seismic-seiche.asset.connection.script.9",
      "samples": 156600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "devils-hole-cue-10",
      "transcript": "This event removed some material from the shelf. The park described it as a minor disturbance.",
      "file": "audio/devils-hole/narration/cue-10.wav",
      "start": 47.333333333333336,
      "duration": 6.3,
      "beatIndex": 9,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "devils-hole-seismic-seiche.asset.connection.script.10",
      "samples": 151200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "devils-hole-cue-11",
      "transcript": "An isolated-looking pool can reveal just how connected the ground beneath us really is.",
      "file": "audio/devils-hole/narration/cue-11.wav",
      "start": 53.86666666666667,
      "duration": 5.825,
      "beatIndex": 10,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "devils-hole-seismic-seiche.asset.connection.script.11",
      "samples": 139800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    }
  ],
